      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她不能够只管努力跑。\n在最后直线让能量一口气爆发的话，\n呼吸会变得极度痛苦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d43ecee4f461f1cc6abff9fe664173281c914659e4233f379ef728a37fea501",
