      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我看着她离去的背影……思考着。\n照理说，她是可以直到最后都不跟我们摊牌的。\n但是……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9f35ec25af3a20de6e082e813a67451365318373c99d638206e7f028f3bc4a7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
